From: johnnylibretexts <264531926+johnnylibretexts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:15:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] fix(a11y): require a reviewed preview before apply and report
 empty writes

Two gaps found while documenting the remediation workflow:

- The matrix "Fix issues with Remedy" modal applied straight from a
  preview, while the work-queue path required an explicit
  acknowledgement. Apply now needs the same tick in both places.
- The work queue reported "Apply completed" even when the bridge wrote
  nothing (the preview held no content change). It now says no changes
  were written, using the bridge's own `applied` flag.

Tests: client 19/19 (two new cases cover both apply outcomes),
server 24/24, tsc clean, vite build clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
